{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-建站与落地页\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"通过此接口，用户可以更改橙子建站站点状态。更改前，可在【获取橙子建站站点详细信息】的返回参数中获取当前站点状态，站点状态枚举值详见【站点状态】，状态不同，可对应的操作会做相应限制。新建的站点和恢复删除的站点都需要发布后才可生效投入使用。\",\"id\":\"tools.site.update_status\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/site/update_status/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1696710618884096\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.site.get_detail\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620022799\",\"reason\":\"更改站点状态前，需要先获取当前站点状态\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取橙子建站站点详细信息\"},{\"id\":\"tools.site.get_list\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad\\u0026type=api\\u0026id=1696710620579852\",\"reason\":\"请求参数中的站点id列表可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取橙子建站站点列表\"},{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求Header中的授权access-token需要通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710618884096\",\"title\":\"更改橙子建站站点状态\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ibxuKor3\">通过此接口，用户可以更改橙子建站站点状态</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-rlNt2Irz\"><br/></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-R4npTytw\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dUn5ah7v\">更改橙子建站站点状态前，可在<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620022799\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取橙子建站站点详细信息</a>的返回参数中获取当前站点状态<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">status</span></code> ; 站点状态的枚举值详见 <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535#custom-anchor-%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【站点状态】</a>，状态不同，可对应的操作会做相应限制。如<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">DELETED</span> </code>和<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">AUDIT_BANNED</span></code>状态下不可再上线；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">EDIT</span></code>状态下不可直接使用。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-s0yat5gm%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-aT6fdw8Q%5C%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E5%BB%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%8A%95%E5%85%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-rlAt0qXi%5C%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%221RIGL%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-s0yat5gm%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-aT6fdw8Q%5C%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E5%BB%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%90%8E%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E6%8A%95%E5%85%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-rlAt0qXi%5C%22%3E%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M4